  "description": "SPARTA D-RULE FIT – STYLISH AND VERSATILE\n\nThe SPARTA d-RULE FIT is the perfect combination of style and advanced technology. With its modern design and powerful electric assistance, the d-RULE FIT offers an effortless riding experience, whether you're cruising through the city or exploring the countryside.\n\nEnjoy the convenience of a Bosch Purion 200 display, smartphone connectivity options, and premium build quality that ensures long-lasting ease of use.\n\nThe d-RULE FIT is now exclusively available with a low step-through frame for easy mounting and dismounting. Wide tires, a suspension seatpost, and a duoshock fork ensure a smooth and comfortable ride.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands. Please note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
